  "hasSol": true,
  "task_html": "<div class='task-block' style='background:#7c3aed18;border:1.5px solid #7c3aed40;'><div class='task-block-label' style='color:#7c3aed;'>Das Geradendreieck</div><div style='background:#ede9fe;border:1.5px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:2;'>Drei Geraden schlie&szlig;en ein Dreieck ein:<br><span style='color:#2563eb;font-weight:700;'>f(x) = x + 2</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span style='color:#16a34a;font-weight:700;'>g(x) = &minus;2x + 8</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span style='color:#d97706;font-weight:700;'>h(x) = &minus;0,5x &minus; 1</span></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0 14px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 280 225' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-height:225px;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='280' height='225' rx='12' fill='#f5f3ff'/><line x1='0' y1='210' x2='262' y2='210' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='0' y1='170' x2='262' y2='170' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='0' y1='90' x2='262' y2='90' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='0' y1='50' x2='262' y2='50' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='40' y1='8' x2='40' y2='220' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='120' y1='8' x2='120' y2='220' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='160' y1='8' x2='160' y2='220' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='200' y1='8' x2='200' y2='220' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='6' y1='130' x2='262' y2='130' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='80' y1='6' x2='80' y2='220' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='40' y='142' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-2</text><text x='120' y='142' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='160' y='142' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='200' y='142' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>6</text><text x='74' y='93' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='74' y='53' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='74' y='173' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-2</text><text x='74' y='213' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-4</text><polygon points='120,50 40,130 200,210' fill='#7c3aed14' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='5,3'/><line x1='0' y1='170' x2='160' y2='10' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='100' y1='10' x2='202' y2='214' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='0' y1='110' x2='210' y2='214' stroke='#d97706' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='162' y='12' font-size='11' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700'>f</text><text x='87' y='11' font-size='11' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>g</text><text x='3' y='108' font-size='11' fill='#d97706' font-weight='700'>h</text><circle cx='120' cy='50' r='5' fill='#7c3aed' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='40' cy='130' r='5' fill='#7c3aed' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='200' cy='210' r='5' fill='#7c3aed' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><text x='126' y='46' font-size='12' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='800'>A</text><text x='20' y='127' font-size='12' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='800'>B</text><text x='206' y='222' font-size='12' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='800'>C</text></svg></div><div style='display:grid;gap:8px;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>a)</span> Berechne die drei Eckpunkte des Dreiecks:<br><span style='font-size:13px;color:#555;margin-left:16px;'>A = f &cap; g &nbsp;&nbsp; B = f &cap; h &nbsp;&nbsp; C = g &cap; h</span></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>b)</span> Trage alle drei Eckpunkte in die Skizze ein. &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fe: Liegen A, B, C wirklich auf den Geraden?</div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>c)</span> Berechne den Fl&auml;cheninhalt des Dreiecks ABC.<br><div style='background:#ede9fe;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;'><strong>Formel:</strong> F = &frac12; &middot; |x&#x2090;(y&#x2091;&minus;y&#x2102;) + x&#x2091;(y&#x2102;&minus;y&#x2090;) + x&#x2102;(y&#x2090;&minus;y&#x2091;)|<br><span style='color:#888;font-size:12px;'>A=(x&#x2090;|y&#x2090;), B=(x&#x2091;|y&#x2091;), C=(x&#x2102;|y&#x2102;)</span></div></div></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;'><p style='font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>Schritt 1: Schnittpunkte berechnen</p><div style='display:grid;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;'><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><strong style='color:#2563eb;'>A = f &cap; g:</strong><br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>x + 2 = &minus;2x + 8<br>3x = 6 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x = 2 &nbsp;|&nbsp; y = 4 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; </span><strong>A(2|4)</strong></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><strong style='color:#16a34a;'>B = f &cap; h:</strong><br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>x + 2 = &minus;0,5x &minus; 1<br>1,5x = &minus;3 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x = &minus;2 &nbsp;|&nbsp; y = 0 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; </span><strong>B(&minus;2|0)</strong></div><div style='background:#fffbeb;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><strong style='color:#d97706;'>C = g &cap; h:</strong><br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>&minus;2x + 8 = &minus;0,5x &minus; 1<br>&minus;1,5x = &minus;9 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x = 6 &nbsp;|&nbsp; y = &minus;4 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; </span><strong>C(6|&minus;4)</strong></div></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0 14px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 280 225' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-height:225px;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='280' height='225' rx='12' fill='#f5f3ff'/><line x1='0' y1='210' x2='262' y2='210' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='0' y1='170' x2='262' y2='170' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='0' y1='90' x2='262' y2='90' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='0' y1='50' x2='262' y2='50' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='40' y1='8' x2='40' y2='220' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='120' y1='8' x2='120' y2='220' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='160' y1='8' x2='160' y2='220' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='200' y1='8' x2='200' y2='220' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='6' y1='130' x2='262' y2='130' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='80' y1='6' x2='80' y2='220' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='40' y='142' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-2</text><text x='120' y='142' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='160' y='142' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='200' y='142' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>6</text><text x='74' y='93' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='74' y='53' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='74' y='173' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-2</text><text x='74' y='213' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#a78bfa'>-4</text><polygon points='120,50 40,130 200,210' fill='#7c3aed22' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='0' y1='170' x2='160' y2='10' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='100' y1='10' x2='202' y2='214' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='0' y1='110' x2='210' y2='214' stroke='#d97706' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='162' y='12' font-size='11' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700'>f</text><text x='87' y='11' font-size='11' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>g</text><text x='3' y='108' font-size='11' fill='#d97706' font-weight='700'>h</text><circle cx='120' cy='50' r='5' fill='#7c3aed' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='40' cy='130' r='5' fill='#7c3aed' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='200' cy='210' r='5' fill='#7c3aed' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><text x='126' y='46' font-size='11' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='700'>A(2|4)</text><text x='15' y='124' font-size='11' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='700'>B(-2|0)</text><text x='175' y='222' font-size='11' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='700'>C(6|-4)</text></svg></div><p style='font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin:4px 0 8px;'>Schritt 2: Fl&auml;cheninhalt</p><div style='background:#f5f3ff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:2.2;'>F = &frac12; &middot; |2&middot;(0&minus;(&minus;4)) + (&minus;2)&middot;((&minus;4)&minus;4) + 6&middot;(4&minus;0)|<br>F = &frac12; &middot; |2&middot;4 + (&minus;2)&middot;(&minus;8) + 6&middot;4|<br>F = &frac12; &middot; |8 + 16 + 24|<br>F = &frac12; &middot; 48 = <strong style='font-size:16px;color:#7c3aed;'>24</strong></div></div>"
}
